msgstr "Bu fayl boshqa plagindan (%s) eksport qilingan, shuning uchun uni bu yerga import qilish ushbu plagin tushunmaydigan sozlamalarni saqlaydi."

#. translators: %d: how many settings were imported.
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin-ui.php:1233
#, php-format
