msgstr "Uni menyuga qo'shmang"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:483
msgid "Edit any translation here. An edited translation is kept exactly as you wrote it and is never overwritten when the page is translated again."
msgstr "Bu yerda istalgan tarjimani tahrirlang. Tahrirlangan tarjima aynan qanday yozgan bo'lsangiz shunday saqlanadi va sahifa qaytadan tarjima qilinganda hech qachon ustidan yozib yuborilmaydi."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:504
msgid "Every language"
msgstr "Har bir til"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:511
msgid "Search translations"
msgstr "Tarjimalarni qidirish"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:512
msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Filtrlash"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:517
msgid "Content"
msgstr "Kontent"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:518
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Til"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:519
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "Tarjima"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:520
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Holat"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:521
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:540
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Saqlash"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:526
msgid "Nothing translated yet. Publish a language and translation starts in the background."
msgstr "Hali hech narsa tarjima qilinmagan. Tilni chop eting va tarjima fonda boshlanadi."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:559
msgid "These addresses are live. Open any of them to check it, and submit the sitemap index to Google Search Console."
msgstr "Bu manzillar ishlayotir. Ulardan birini ochib tekshirib ko'ring va sayt xaritasi ko'rsatkichini Google Search Console'ga yuboring."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:580
msgid "You are not allowed to edit translations on this site."
msgstr "Sizga bu saytdagi tarjimalarni tahrirlashga ruxsat etilmagan."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:608
msgid "Edited by you — kept"
msgstr "Siz tahrirladingiz — saqlangan"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:610
msgid "Source changed — will be redone"
msgstr "Manba oʻzgardi — qaytadan bajariladi"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:612
msgid "Up to date"
msgstr "Yangilangan"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-connection.php:58
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Ulangan"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-connection.php:60
msgid "Connecting…"
msgstr "Ulanmoqda…"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-connection.php:62
msgid "Connected, but something needs attention"
msgstr "Ulangan, lekin nimadir e'tiborni talab qiladi"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-connection.php:64
msgid "Not connected"
msgstr "Ulanmagan"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-connection.php:66
msgid "Running on your own account"
msgstr "O'z hisobingizdan ishlamoqda"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-connection.php:68
msgid "We could not check this"
msgstr "Buni tekshira olmadik"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-connection.php:93
msgid "This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look."
msgstr "Ushbu plagin nima sababdan ekanligini ko'rsatmadi. Diagnostika hisobotini yuboring va biz buni ko'rib chiqamiz."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-connection.php:161
msgid "Connection status"
msgstr "Ulanish holati"

#. translators: %s: a human-readable interval such as "5 minutes".
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-connection.php:189
#, php-format
msgid "Last checked %s ago."
msgstr "Oxirgi marta %s oldin tekshirilgan."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-connection.php:251
msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(yangi tabda ochiladi)"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-diagnostics.php:199
msgid "Send this to Zinn® support"
msgstr "Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga yuborish"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-diagnostics.php:201
msgid "This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it."
msgstr "Aynan shu yuboriladi — boshqa hech narsa va hech qanday yashirin narsa yo'q. Parollaringiz, tokenlaringiz va API kalitlaringiz uning ichida yo'q."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-diagnostics.php:204
msgid "The diagnostics report that will be sent"
msgstr "Yuboriladigan diagnostika hisoboti"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-diagnostics.php:207
msgid "Copy to clipboard"
msgstr "Vaqtinchalik xotiraga nusxalash"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-diagnostics.php:214
msgid "Send this report to Zinn® support"
msgstr "Ushbu hisobotni Zinn® qo'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga yuboring"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-diagnostics.php:216
msgid "We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself."
msgstr "Biz siz uchun qo'llab-quvvatlash so'rovini ochamiz va elektron pochta orqali javob beramiz. Agar buni yuborishni xohlamasangiz, uni yuqoridan nusxalab oling va o'zingiz so'rovga qo'ying."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-diagnostics.php:228
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "Nusxa olindi"

#. translators: %s: the transport error reported by WordPress.
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-diagnostics.php:274
#, php-format
msgid "We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong."
msgstr "Ushbu serverdan (%s) Zinn Digital® bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi. Yuqoridagi hisobotni nusxalab oling va uning o‘rniga chekin oching — sozlamalaringizda hech qanday xato yo‘q."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-diagnostics.php:288
msgid "Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email."
msgstr "Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati xabaringizni qabul qildi va elektron pochta orqali javob beradi."

#. translators: %s: the support reference for the report just sent.
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-diagnostics.php:291
#, php-format
msgid "Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email."
msgstr "Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati xabaringizni qabul qildi — maʼlumot raqami %s — va elektron pochta orqali javob beradi."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-diagnostics.php:300
msgid "You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive."
msgstr "Qisqa vaqt ichida bir nechta hisobot yubordingiz. Bir necha daqiqa kutib, qaytadan urinib koʻring — avvalgi yuborganlaringiz yetib kelgan."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-diagnostics.php:307
msgid "Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket."
msgstr "Zinn Digital® hozircha hisobotni qabul qila olmadi — bu bizning tomonda, siznikida emas. Ozgina vaqtdan keyin yana urinib ko‘ring yoki yuqoridagi hisobotni tiketga nusxalang."

